<title>NEW ZEALAND: Capital Group reduces Lion Nathan stake.</title>
<headline>Capital Group reduces Lion Nathan stake.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>United States fund manager Capital Group said on Monday it had reduced its relevant interest in Lion Nathan to 4.93 percent.</p>
<p>Capital Group is the parent of six investments management companies which previously had a collective interest of 5.67 percent in the trans-Tasman brewer.</p>
<p>Capital Group said that between July 24 and August 14 those funds disposed of 4.035 million shares.</p>
